{
  "_doc": "Voice settings shared by every agent that reads its replies aloud (hooks/speak.py). `mode`: `on-demand` keeps the last reply for `lis` (tools/lis), `auto` also plays every reply. Paths starting with ~ are expanded. AGENT_VOICE=0 in the environment overrides `enabled`, which only gates `auto` playback. `units` are replaced only right after a number, case-sensitive. `lexicon` replaces whole words, case-insensitive: a word Piper mispronounces is added there, spelled as a French reader would say it.",
  "mode": "on-demand",
  "enabled": true,
  "piper": "~/.local/share/piper/piper/piper",
  "voices_dir": "~/.local/share/piper/voices",
  "voice": "fr_FR-siwis-medium",
  "length_scale": 1.0,
  "max_chars": 800,
